# Build artefacts and local state never belong in an upload. Without this the
# API deployment ships the admin's .next folder and the mobile's web export,
# which roughly triples the upload size for no benefit.

node_modules
.vercel
**/.next
**/dist
**/build
**/.expo
**/.web-preview

apps/api/dist
apps/mobile/dist

*.log
dev.log
webexport.log
websrv.log

.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
deploy/vercel-env.mjs

# Root-anchored: a bare `docs` also matched `apps/api/src/docs`, which holds the
# OpenAPI document the server imports at startup.
/docs
*.md
!README.md